{#
  Reserved photography slot. Real licensed photography has not been
  sourced yet (see docs/photography-plan.md for the full brief per
  page). Renders a considered abstract placeholder — never a fake or
  scraped photo — sized and composed exactly as the final photograph
  should be, so swapping in a real image later is a one-line change.

  Usage: {{ mediaPanel("airport-vip", "wide", "light") }}
  - motifIcon: icon name from icons.njk to use as the faint motif
  - variant: "" (4:3, default) | "wide" (16:9) | "square"
  - tone: "" (deep green, default) | "light" (cream/tint)
#}
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}
{%- macro mediaPanel(motifIcon, variant="", tone="") -%}
<div class="media-panel{% if variant == 'wide' %} media-panel--wide{% elif variant == 'square' %} media-panel--square{% endif %}{% if tone == 'light' %} media-panel--light{% endif %}" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="media-panel__motif">{{ icon(motifIcon, 220) }}</span>
</div>
{%- endmacro -%}
